---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Footer from "../components/astro/Footernew.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/astro/Navbarnew.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy | SWOTBee"
  description="Learn about how SWOTBee uses cookies and similar technologies on our website. Understand our cookie policy and how it affects your browsing experience."
>
  <Navbar />
  <section class="max-w-7xl px-8 lg:px-10 py-16 pb-0" data-aos="fade-up">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-sky-surge-800">Terms and Conditions</h2>
    <div class="py-12 bg-coral-glow-50 sm:py-12">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none">
          <h1
            class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-sky-surge-800 text-pretty sm:text-5xl"
          >
            Cookie Policy
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base text-gray-500">
            Effective Date: June, 1, 2025
          </p>
          <p class="mt-6">
            This Cookie Policy explains how SWOTBee ("we", "us", or "our") uses
            cookies and similar technologies to recognize you when you visit our
            website. It explains what these technologies are, why we use them,
            and your rights to control our use of them.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold text-sky-surge-800">
            1. What Are Cookies?
          </h2>
          <p>
            Cookies are small data files placed on your computer or mobile
            device when you visit a website. They are widely used to make
            websites work, improve efficiency, and provide reporting
            information.
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-sky-surge-800">First-party cookies:</strong> Set
              by SWOTBee and used to operate our website and services.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-sky-surge-800">Third-party cookies:</strong> Set
              by parties other than SWOTBee (e.g., analytics, advertising) to enable
              features or functionality provided through the website.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold text-sky-surge-800">
            2. Why Do We Use Cookies?
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-sky-surge-800">Essential cookies:</strong> Required
              for technical reasons to operate our website and provide you with services.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-sky-surge-800"
                >Analytics and customization cookies:</strong
              > Help us understand how our website is being used, assess the effectiveness
              of marketing campaigns, and customize your experience.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-sky-surge-800">Advertising cookies:</strong> Used
              by third parties to deliver relevant advertisements and measure their
              effectiveness.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-sky-surge-800">Unclassified cookies:</strong> Cookies
              that are in the process of being categorized with their providers.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold text-sky-surge-800">
            3. Types of Cookies We Use
          </h2>
          <table class="min-w-full mt-4 mb-6 text-sm border">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th class="px-2 py-1 border text-sky-surge-800">Name</th>
                <th class="px-2 py-1 border text-sky-surge-800">Purpose</th>
                <th class="px-2 py-1 border text-sky-surge-800">Provider</th>
                <th class="px-2 py-1 border text-sky-surge-800">Type</th>
                <th class="px-2 py-1 border text-sky-surge-800">Expires</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-2 py-1 border">NID</td>
                <td class="px-2 py-1 border"
                  >Set by Google to assign a unique user ID and remember user
                  preferences.</td
                >
                <td class="px-2 py-1 border">.google.com</td>
                <td class="px-2 py-1 border">server_cookie</td>
                <td class="px-2 py-1 border">6 months</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-2 py-1 border">__gsas</td>
                <td class="px-2 py-1 border"
                  >Unclassified (currently being categorized).</td
                >
                <td class="px-2 py-1 border">.swotbee.com</td>
                <td class="px-2 py-1 border">http_cookie</td>
                <td class="px-2 py-1 border">1 year 24 days</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
          <p>
            Please note: The specific cookies used may change depending on the
            features and services you access.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold text-sky-surge-800">
            4. How Can I Control Cookies?
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
            <li>
              You have the right to decide whether to accept or reject cookies.
              You can set your cookie preferences using our Cookie Consent
              Manager, found in the notification banner and on our website.
            </li>
            <li>
              Essential cookies cannot be rejected as they are strictly
              necessary for the website to function.
            </li>
            <li>
              You may also set or amend your web browser controls to accept or
              refuse cookies. For more information, visit your browser's help
              menu.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4">Learn how to manage cookies in popular browsers:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
            <li>Chrome</li>
            <li>Internet Explorer</li>
            <li>Firefox</li>
            <li>Safari</li>
            <li>Edge</li>
            <li>Opera</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4">
            Most advertising networks also offer an option to opt out of
            targeted advertising. For more, visit the Digital Advertising
            Alliance, Digital Advertising Alliance of Canada, or the European
            Interactive Digital Advertising Alliance.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold text-sky-surge-800">
            5. Other Tracking Technologies
          </h2>
          <p>
            We may use technologies similar to cookies, such as web beacons
            (tracking pixels or clear gifs), to recognize users, monitor traffic
            patterns, and assess the effectiveness of email marketing campaigns.
            These technologies often rely on cookies to function; declining
            cookies may impair their operation.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold text-sky-surge-800">
            6. Flash Cookies or Local Shared Objects
          </h2>
          <p>
            Some website features may use “Flash Cookies” (Local Shared Objects)
            to collect and store information. You can manage Flash Cookies via
            your Flash player settings. Restricting Flash Cookies may affect
            certain site functionalities.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold text-sky-surge-800">
            7. Targeted Advertising
          </h2>
          <p>
            Third parties may use cookies to serve advertising through our
            website. These cookies help deliver relevant ads and measure their
            effectiveness. The information collected does not directly identify
            you unless you provide it.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold text-sky-surge-800">
            8. Updates to This Cookie Policy
          </h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time to reflect
            changes in our practices or for operational, legal, or regulatory
            reasons. Please revisit this page regularly to stay informed. The
            date at the top indicates when it was last updated.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold text-sky-surge-800">
            9. Contact Us
          </h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions about our use of cookies or other
            technologies, please contact us at:
          </p>
          <address>
            <p>
              Email: <a
                href="mailto:support@swotbee.com"
                class="font-semibold text-sky-surge-800 hover:underline hover:text-coral-glow-400"
                >support@swotbee.com</a
              >
            </p>
            <p>SWOTBee</p>
            <p>Headquarters: Chennai, Tamil Nadu, India</p>
          </address>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
